# # /aril/
#
# Persistent identifiers for a metadata vocabulary for animal behaviour data:
# the model, its SHACL shapes, its terms and its error codes.
#
# https://w3id.org/aril/... redirects to
# https://benoitjt-girard.github.io/aril/...
#
# The target is a placeholder and will change as hosting changes. The identifiers
# will not: they are frozen once minted, including through promotion and deprecation.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:  
#
# Benoît Girard
# GitHub username: BenoitJT-GIRARD

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://benoitjt-girard.github.io/aril/$1 [R=302,L]
